From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 12:23:36 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: arm64: dts: qcom: sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246:
 Enable the WLAN
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The supplies are the downstream node's: PM6450 L11 for CX/MX, PM6150L L1
for the XO, PM6450 L14 for RFA, and PM6150L L10 and L11 for the two 3.3 V
chains.

To be folded into the board DT once it has probed on the device.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 .../dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts    | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
index 42293d5de..77fb96890 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
@@ -596,3 +596,13 @@ &usb_1_hsphy {
 
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+&wifi {
+	vdd-0.8-cx-mx-supply = <&pm6450_l11>;
+	vdd-1.8-xo-supply = <&pm6150l_l1>;
+	vdd-1.3-rfa-supply = <&pm6450_l14>;
+	vdd-3.3-ch0-supply = <&pm6150l_l10>;
+	vdd-3.3-ch1-supply = <&pm6150l_l11>;
+
+	status = "okay";
+};
